{"id":"conv_03921","context":"A student journalist interviews a doctor about engineering applied to medical devices","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["ren_uni","saito_doctor"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Doctor, thank you for your time today. A friend from my university's engineering department is involved in medical device development, which sparked my interest.","jp":"先生、今日はお時間ありがとうございます。大学の工学部の友人が、医療機器の開発に関わっていて、それで興味を持ったんです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,6,8,14,17,18,26,39,56,94,111,141,185,228,302,340,492,558,758,785,845,2062,2170,3441,4537,5401,7885,8416,11411],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"今日","r":"きょう","w":141},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"大学","r":"だいがく","w":302},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"工学部","r":"こうがくぶ","w":11411},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"友人","r":"ゆうじん","w":785},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"医療","r":"いりょう","w":758},{"s":"機器","r":"きき","w":2170},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"開発","r":"かいはつ","w":340},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"関わっ","r":"かかわっ","w":3441},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"それで","w":2062},{"s":"興味","r":"きょうみ","w":845},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"持っ","r":"もっ","w":558},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"saito_doctor","mood":null,"en":"Not at all. In modern medical practice, engineering knowledge is truly indispensable. Artificial joints made from metals like titanium have greatly changed patients' lives.","jp":"いえいえ。最近の医療現場では、工学の知識が本当に欠かせないんですよ。特にチタンなどの金属を使った人工関節は、患者さんの生活を大きく変えました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,6,7,8,13,14,17,26,28,50,53,68,223,229,245,284,289,291,591,629,758,781,1014,1039,1089,1199,1988,2098,3608,4095,4113,4241,4781,6158,7195,12608,14530,17096,19410],"jpTokens":[{"s":"いえいえ","w":17096},{"s":"。"},{"s":"最近","r":"さいきん","w":223},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"医療","r":"いりょう","w":758},{"